every once in awhile the nethack explorer should meet up with
a travelling gypsy family. every gypsy family would have at
least a husband and a wife and possibly one or two kids. often
the gypsies will try to sell you their musical instruments or
whatever else they happen to be carrying. gupsies might buy
your gems at 1/10 their value.

the gypsies would appear and disappear outside of your direct
field of vision (disappear behind a door or something).

the gypsy couple would engage in continual chatter and spread
rumors. interestingly, the gypsy of your sex would tell mostly
true rumors and the one of the opposite sex would tell mostly
false rumors.

if there are gypsy children other interesting things could
happen. occasionally you would overhear the parents tell the
children _enlightening_ things about you (i.e. "yes, magda,
he is poison resistant, now go play."). being uncontrollable,
the children may occasionally pick your pockets, unnoticed!
of course, they might attempt to sell you back your own items.

attacking gypsies would be unwise since when angered they
become curse-casting magic users quite capable of killing you.
also, there's at least two of them and only one of you!, and
they all anger when one gets angry. normally gypsies are
"friendly" humans.

if this sounds like mutant stooge vending machines that's just
coincidence ...

